| Element | Location | Notes / Risk |
|---|---|---|
| **Role Types** | `src/types/*.ts` | CEO is hardcoded in types for Org, Compliance, Audit, and Assets. |
| **Auth Store** | `src/store/auth.ts` | The role is stored in `localStorage` under the `auth-storage` key. |
